            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King David commanded all the officials of Israel to assemble in Jerusalem. So all the officials of the tribes, the officials who administered the work of the kingdom, the leaders of the clans, the supervisors of the property and livestock that belonged to the king and his sons — indeed all the palace officials, leading soldiers, and important men — gathered in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7.1–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Chr 17.1–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David stood before them and addressed them: “My friends, listen to me. I wanted to build a permanent home for the Covenant Box, the footstool of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God. I have made preparations for building a temple to honour him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but he has forbidden me to do it, because I am a soldier and have shed too much blood. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, chose me and my descendants to rule Israel for ever. He chose the tribe of Judah to provide leadership, and out of Judah he chose my father's family. From all that family it was his pleasure to take me and make me king over all Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He gave me many sons, and out of them all he chose Solomon to rule over Israel, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s kingdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to me, ‘Your son Solomon is the one who will build my Temple. I have chosen him to be my son, and I will be his father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will make his kingdom last for ever if he continues to obey carefully all my laws and commands as he does now.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“So now, my people, in the presence of our God and of this assembly of all Israel, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s people, I charge you to obey carefully everything that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " our God has commanded us, so that you may continue to possess this good land and so that you may hand it on to succeeding generations for ever.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And to Solomon he said, “My son, I charge you to acknowledge your father's God and to serve him with an undivided heart and a willing mind. He knows all our thoughts and desires. If you go to him, he will accept you; but if you turn away from him, he will abandon you for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You must realize that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has chosen you to build his holy Temple. Now do it — and do it with determination.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David gave Solomon the plans for all the temple buildings, for the storerooms and all the other rooms, and for the Most Holy Place, where sins are forgiven. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also gave him the plans for all he had in mind for the courtyards and the rooms around them, and for the storerooms for the temple equipment and the gifts dedicated to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "David also gave him the plans for organizing the priests and Levites to perform their duties, to do the work of the Temple, and to take care of all the temple utensils. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He gave instructions as to how much silver and gold was to be used for making the utensils, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for each lamp and lampstand, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the silver tables, and for each gold table on which were placed the loaves of bread offered to God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He also gave instructions as to how much pure gold was to be used in making forks, bowls, and jars, how much silver and gold in making dishes, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and how much pure gold in making the altar on which incense was burnt and in making the chariot for the winged creatures that spread their wings over the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s Covenant Box. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King David said, “All this is contained in the plan written according to the instructions which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " himself gave me to carry out.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King David said to his son Solomon, “Be confident and determined. Start the work and don't let anything stop you. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God, whom I serve, will be with you. He will not abandon you, but he will stay with you until you finish the work to be done on his Temple. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The priests and the Levites have been assigned duties to perform in the Temple. Workers with every kind of skill are eager to help you, and all the people and their leaders are at your command.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
